    "epidemiology",
    "genomics"
  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The definitive open academic knowledge graph — 250M+ works, CC0, free REST API, no authentication required. Unique value for research software cataloging: ROR institution IDs on author affiliations (enabling governance inference), funder metadata (grant → institution → governance), citation counts (adoption signal), and open-access PDF links. Successor to Microsoft Academic Graph with better coverage and open licensing. Used by Elicit, Semantic Scholar, and major academic discovery platforms as a data layer. Adopt as the primary scholarly enrichment source for any system linking research software to its academic literature.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-06-12",
  "mach:evidence": [
    {
      "@type": "schema:WebPage",
      "url": "https://api.openalex.org",
